@startuml grants
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam shadowing false
title Agreed bearer grant lifecycle — approval, persistence and revocation
[*] --> Pending : client submits credential digest + request
Pending --> Active : local console or existing manager\napproves capability subset; durable commit
Pending --> Denied : authorized denial
Pending --> Expired : pending request exceeds 24 hours
[*] --> Active : local console or existing manager\ncreates manual grant; one-time secret
Active --> Revoked : authorized revoke; durable commit\nblocks subsequent dispatch admission
Revoked --> [*]
Denied --> [*]
Expired --> [*]
note right of Pending
Requester may poll only its own status.
Possessing a pending credential grants
no provider or management authority.
end note
note left of Active
Agreed: transferable bearer credential.
Check the live grant on every request.
Restart preserves it; no automatic expiry.
Client stores the secret in Keychain
or a protected file.
end note
note right of Revoked
An already admitted native action may finish.
No later action may start under this grant.
Revocation does not undo completed effects.
end note
@enduml
